## Conclusion

This experiment demonstrates how to configure and evaluate serial versus parallel training with Scikit-learn, while using MLflow to track model-training performance. The recorded execution achieved a speedup of approximately **1.59×**, with training time decreasing from about `0.5021 seconds` to `0.3153 seconds`.

The experiment provides a reproducible foundation for comparing training configurations and investigating how CPU parallelism affects machine-learning workloads.
